  * `operator.determinant()` is `O(L_determinant + L_solve*N*K + K^2*N + K^3)`

  If instead `operator` and `x` have shape `[B1,...,Bb, M, N]` and
  `[B1,...,Bb, N, R]`, every operation increases in complexity by `B1*...*Bb`.

